<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 161-4 V SRI LANKA AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 161-4 V SRI LANKA AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, chasing a victory target</p>
<p>of 373, were 161-4 at tea on the last day of the second and</p>
<p>final test match against Sri Lanka on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 and 415-7 declared, India 375 and</p>
<p>161-4.</p>
